* `thresholdRule`

## Resolution-side oracle data

* `resolutionTimestamp`
* `finalOraclePrice`
* `finalOraclePublishedAt`
* `finalOracleRoundId` if available
* `resolutionSchedule`

This is the minimum needed for full traceability.

