# Round State Machine

## States
- Scheduled
- Open
- Locked
- Closed
- Resolved
- Claimable
- Settled
- Cancelled

## Allowed transitions
Scheduled -> Open
Open -> Locked
Locked -> Closed
Closed -> Resolved
Resolved -> Claimable
Claimable -> Settled

Open -> Cancelled
Locked -> Cancelled
Closed -> Cancelled

## Invariants
- users may only enter when round is Open
- lock may only happen once
- close may only happen once
- claim may only happen when round is Claimable
- refund may only happen when round is Cancelled
- sweep_unclaimed may only happen after claim deadline
